    "text": "<p>For the reaction,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mover><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>For the reaction,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the overall rate is given by:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced></mrow><mi>dt</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>"
